  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "fc_public",
      "lane": "python",
      "step": 0,
      "title": "公开 forward 进入 autograd",
      "subtitle": "Module → Function.apply",
      "symbol": "MegaMoeBF16Train.forward",
      "description": [
        "调用 op(...) 时，nn.Module 的调用机制进入 MegaMoeBF16Train.forward。它校验 max_recv_tokens、clipping limit 与保存模式，再调用 _MegaMoeBF16TrainFunction.apply(self, x, IDs, p, W1, W2, ...)。",
        "启用梯度且有浮点输入需要求导时，apply 建立自定义 autograd 节点并执行 Function.forward。PyTorch 因此知道后续反传应调用哪个 Function.backward。",
        "这里的 save_gmm1_output 默认 bf16；本图选择 canonical 权重、K7168、F3072 和关闭 clipping。"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "X、IDs、p、W1、W2、max_recv_tokens"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "自定义autograd调用"
      ],
      "waits": [],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "experiments/megamoe_train/python/deep_ep_experimental/megamoe_train/bf16.py",
          "anchor": "        return _MegaMoeBF16TrainFunction.apply(",
          "before": 7,
          "after": 3
        }
      ],
      "formula": "op(...) → Module.forward(...) → Function.apply(...) → Function.forward(...)"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc_function",
      "lane": "python",
      "step": 1,
      "title": "Function.forward 调执行器",
      "subtitle": "检查实例与stream状态",
      "symbol": "_MegaMoeBF16TrainFunction.forward",
      "description": [
        "Function.forward 先调用 op._check_ready，默认只在本地检查 p dtype 是否为 BF16 或 FP32，再调用 op._executor.forward。_executor 是训练包 _C.BF16 对象，负责启动前向 kernel。整数 IDs 用于路由，p 是 BF16 或 FP32 的可微浮点输入。",
        "构造时设置 debug_collectives=True，才在每次原生调用前集体核对当前前向／反向阶段和 p dtype。各 rank 仍须保证 dtype 和调用顺序相容；该检查不核对图身份、全部调用参数或完整操作序列。",
        "ctx 是本次 Function 调用的上下文。前向结束后，它保存本次反向需要的 Tensor 和调用配置；反向时由 autograd 把同一个 ctx 交给 Function.backward。"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "op、所有前向输入"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "ForwardResult引用"
      ],
      "waits": [
        "Module存活、创建stream一致"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "experiments/megamoe_train/python/deep_ep_experimental/megamoe_train/bf16.py",
          "anchor": "    def forward(ctx, op, x, ids, weights, w1, w2, max_recv, limit, mode):",
          "after": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
