      "lane": "host",
      "step": 2,
      "title": "pybind 转入 BF16Executor",
      "subtitle": "_C.BF16.forward",
      "symbol": "BF16Executor::forward",
      "description": [
        "pybind把Python方法映射到C++执行器。执行器检查借用地址仍有效，取得通信context，再调用ops命名空间的MegaMoeBF16Forward。"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "Tensor对象、执行器rank/world/窗口"
